The agent rules for this app are tool-agnostic and live in AGENTS.md — read it
before doing anything, then follow it.

In short: never assume requirements — read doc/lavanya-requirements.md and
doc/lavanya-spa-status.md first; update the status doc after every step
(what / how / why / remaining); verify with the doc's §5 playbook; commit only
your own files. Full details in AGENTS.md.
